<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA BEAT THAILAND 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA BEAT THAILAND 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea beat Thailand 3-1 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup soccer Asian zone first round group 6 qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>South Korea - Roh Sang Rae 19, Ha Seok Ju 75, Kim Bong Soo 86</p>
<p>Thailand - Piyapong Pue-on 49</p>
<p>Next Match: March 9, Thailand v Hong Kong.</p>
</text>
